cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this protocol, please cite it as below."
title: "Structured AI-Assisted Evidence Synthesis (SAES)"
abstract: >-
  A three-stage protocol, ontology, and prompt set for AI-assisted
  evidence synthesis from scientific literature. The pipeline runs
  from research question through corpus assembly (SETUP), per-paper
  variable–relationship extraction with audit (EXTRACTION), and
  cross-paper consolidation with provenance (ACCUMULATION).
type: software
